Read `docs/CANON.md` first.

- No em dashes. Short, warm, funny. The joke comes from the character.
- The girls say "Tata" in speech only; every interface and system message says "Tom".
- Nara never speaks words, only barks, whines and sniffs.
- Boppy: stomach, back, people walking too fast. Justin: always at work, mention lightly.
- Never write that Tom or Amy is the "older" or "younger" sibling.
- Changing an existing spoken line silences its baked clip. Do not reword unless asked; if you do, log old and new text in `docs/CHANGES.md`.
- Use `SCENE_OPS` steps (see `engine/story.js`) for cutscenes; extend data before adding engine code.
